  "build_notes": "`build.pad_to_bytes`: the 8x8 PNG of the first case followed by zero bytes up to that many decoded bytes (trailing bytes after the last PNG chunk, which a decoder ignores). `build.png_dims`: a PNG signature and IHDR claiming [width, height] with no pixel data, which is refused on the header alone, before any decode."
